{"id":"da74a4922b7a5745","group":"91","path":"91/91-prop-paradox-sentence-classification.md","title":"规范一致固定点的真值剖面恰有六种","display":"prop-paradox-sentence-classification — 规范一致固定点的真值剖面恰有六种","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-prop-paradox-sentence-classification","aliases":["91-prop-paradox-sentence-classification","91-prop-paradox-classification"],"display":"prop-paradox-sentence-classification — 规范一致固定点的真值剖面恰有六种","depends_on":["[[91-df-minimal-fixed-point]]","[[91-df-truth-value-function]]","[[91-thm-liar-sentence-properties]]","[[91-df-truth-teller-semantic]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-prop-paradox-sentence-classification"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-prop-paradox-sentence-classification</span><span>91-prop-paradox-classification</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-paradox-sentence-classification — 规范一致固定点的真值剖面恰有六种"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"460308c7099a8386\" href=\"?note=460308c7099a8386\" title=\"91-df-minimal-fixed-point\">91-df-minimal-fixed-point</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2bc1263010e83604\" href=\"?note=2bc1263010e83604\" title=\"91-df-truth-value-function\">91-df-truth-value-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"80b21a90a0262f70\" href=\"?note=80b21a90a0262f70\" title=\"91-thm-liar-sentence-properties\">91-thm-liar-sentence-properties</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"8e63bca271dfc8f1\" href=\"?note=8e63bca271dfc8f1\" title=\"91-df-truth-teller-semantic\">91-df-truth-teller-semantic</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J)\">\\(\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J)\\)</span> 为原书标准生成算子的全部一致固定点，含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_{\\min}\">\\(X_{\\min}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_X\">\\(v_X\\)</span> 为强 Kleene 评估。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\">\\(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Prof}_J(\\varphi)\\coloneqq\\{v_X(\\varphi):X\\in\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J)\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{Prof}_J(\\varphi)\\coloneqq\\{v_X(\\varphi):X\\in\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J)\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\">\\(\\lambda\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> 取直接闭项自指句。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}paradox\\text{-}sentence\\text{-}classification}\\vdash\\quad\n\\operatorname{Prof}_J(\\varphi)\\in\n\\bigl\\{\\{\\mathbf t\\},\\{\\mathbf f\\},\\{\\mathbf u\\},\n\\{\\mathbf t,\\mathbf u\\},\\{\\mathbf f,\\mathbf u\\},\\{\\mathbf t,\\mathbf f,\\mathbf u\\}\\bigr\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}paradox\\text{-}sentence\\text{-}classification}\\vdash\\quad\n\\operatorname{Prof}_J(\\varphi)\\in\n\\bigl\\{\\{\\mathbf t\\},\\{\\mathbf f\\},\\{\\mathbf u\\},\n\\{\\mathbf t,\\mathbf u\\},\\{\\mathbf f,\\mathbf u\\},\\{\\mathbf t,\\mathbf f,\\mathbf u\\}\\bigr\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>六种剖面分别由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0=0\">\\(0=0\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0=1\">\\(0=1\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\">\\(\\lambda\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\\lor\\neg\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\lor\\neg\\tau\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\\land\\neg\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\land\\neg\\tau\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> 实现。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>任意非空三值剖面在七个非空子集中。要排除第七种 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{\\mathbf t,\\mathbf f\\}\">\\(\\{\\mathbf t,\\mathbf f\\}\\)</span>，看极小固定点：若其值为真或假，极小性及信息一致性保证所有固定点同值，剖面为单点；否则其值为未定义，剖面必含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf u\">\\(\\mathbf u\\)</span>。故仅剩上述六种。\n真理陈述者能取三个值，强 Kleene 表分别给出其排中律的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{\\mathbf t,\\mathbf u\\}\">\\(\\{\\mathbf t,\\mathbf u\\}\\)</span> 和矛盾式的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{\\mathbf f,\\mathbf u\\}\">\\(\\{\\mathbf f,\\mathbf u\\}\\)</span>，所以六种都实现。这是结合原书固定点结果的本目录分类推论，不冒称原书逐字列出了六分类定理。</p>\n<p>来源：Lemma 15.7、Lemmas 15.13–15.14；由极小性和强 Kleene 表得到的分类推论。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-minimal-fixed-point","status":"resolved","id":"460308c7099a8386","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-minimal-fixed-point]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-truth-value-function","status":"resolved","id":"2bc1263010e83604","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-truth-value-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-thm-liar-sentence-properties","status":"resolved","id":"80b21a90a0262f70","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-thm-liar-sentence-properties]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-truth-teller-semantic","status":"resolved","id":"8e63bca271dfc8f1","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-truth-teller-semantic]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J)","display":false},{"tex":"X_{\\min}","display":false},{"tex":"v_X","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Prof}_J(\\varphi)\\coloneqq\\{v_X(\\varphi):X\\in\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J)\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}paradox\\text{-}sentence\\text{-}classification}\\vdash\\quad\n\\operatorname{Prof}_J(\\varphi)\\in\n\\bigl\\{\\{\\mathbf t\\},\\{\\mathbf f\\},\\{\\mathbf u\\},\n\\{\\mathbf t,\\mathbf u\\},\\{\\mathbf f,\\mathbf u\\},\\{\\mathbf t,\\mathbf f,\\mathbf u\\}\\bigr\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"0=0","display":false},{"tex":"0=1","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau\\lor\\neg\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau\\land\\neg\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"\\{\\mathbf t,\\mathbf f\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf u","display":false},{"tex":"\\{\\mathbf t,\\mathbf u\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\{\\mathbf f,\\mathbf u\\}","display":false}],"bytes":1994,"backlinks":[{"id":"601ad32e52e9aa55","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"525f810b84880b72","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"967c10482b90bea3","anchor":"ref-71","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-prop-paradox-sentence-classification]]"},{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-182","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-prop-paradox-sentence-classification]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-181","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-prop-paradox-sentence-classification]]"}],"outgoing":["460308c7099a8386","2bc1263010e83604","80b21a90a0262f70","8e63bca271dfc8f1"]}